### Unity
# Unity generated directories
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emory[Cc]aptures/

# /Build/ is the Windows player required by the test, so it stays tracked.
# /Builds/ above is Unity's other generated output and stays ignored.

# Asset meta data should only be ignored when the corresponding asset is also ignored
!/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta

